/* Reuses parts of the :: Forest Plant Kiss event */
:: Fishing Forest Lake Plant Kiss Encounter
<<effects>>
<<unset $fishingHookedFish>>
<<generatePlant1>><<person1>>
"Hi there!" You hear a voice behind you. A <<person "normal">> emerges from the treeline at the lake's edge, waving at you cheerfully. <<He>> has <<plant_details>> scattered throughout <<his>> hair, and <<hes>> completely naked.
<<arousal 600>><<garousal>>
<br><br>

The <<person "normal">> glances at your fishing rod, then back at you with a grin. "Catch anything yet? Anyone fishing around here sure needs all the luck they can get." <<He>> thinks for a moment, before smiling. "How about a kiss for luck? Might help." <<He>> closes <<his>> eyes and leans forward, tapping <<his>> finger to <<his>> lips.
<br><br>

<<if $backgroundTraits.includes("plantlover") and $nectar_timer lte 14>>
	<span class="pink">You know <<hes>> a <<personsimple>>. You can smell the nectar on <<his>> lips from here.</span> Your heart races, and you can barely think. You need <<his>> nectar. You need more of the sweet, intoxicating nectar.
	<br><br>

	<<link [[Kiss <<him>>|Forest Plant Kiss]]>><</link>><<promiscuous1>><<kissvirginitywarning>>
	<br>
	<<link [[Refuse|Forest Plant Kiss Refuse]]>><<stress 12>><</link>><<ggstress>>
<<else>>
	<<link [[Kiss <<him>>|Forest Plant Kiss]]>><</link>><<promiscuous1>><<kissvirginitywarning>>
	<br>
	<<link [[Refuse|Forest Plant Kiss Refuse]]>><</link>>
<</if>>

:: Widgets Fishing Forest Lake Plant Kiss [widget]
/* Text that can appear while waiting if a plant person will attack soon */
<<widget "fishingForestLakePlantPersonAttackWaitAmbient">>
	<<addinlineevent 20>>
		<<print either(
			"You feel like something is watching you.",
			"Branches snap in the forest behind you.",
			"The smell of flowers drifts across the water, sweet and intoxicating.",
			"You notice the vines hanging from nearby trees curling in an odd way."
		)>>
		<<set $fishing.fishingForestLake.eventDanger += 1>>
	<</addinlineevent>>
<</widget>>
